{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/azizi-zain-jebel-ali","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":395,"crm_id":"1879","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"ready","title":"Azizi Zain","slug":"azizi-zain-jebel-ali","display_address":"Jebel Ali","building_type":["apartment"],"completion_year":"2025","developer":"Azizi Developments","price":1050000,"display_price":"1.05M","lattitude":25.040267,"longitude":55.138412,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":3,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Azizi Zain is a multi-storey residential complex from the developer Azizi Developers located in the picturesque area of Jebel Ali Village. Apartments with <strong>1, 2 and 3 bedrooms</strong> are available for sale. The apartments offer magnificent views of the pool and the picturesque garden.</p><p>The complex offers world-class amenities for residents: an infinity pool and a children's pool, as well as a spacious recreation area.</p><p>Azizi Zain has an advantageous location: the complex is located next to Al Samuel Street, from where it is easy to reach the main transport interchanges. Discovery Garden Metro Station is just a 7-minute walk away, which provides uninterrupted connection to other areas. Sheikh Zayed Road is nearby, Al Maktoum International Airport and Dubai Mall are a 30-minute drive away, and Dubai Airport is a 50-minute drive away.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/zain_feat_5ccdd22be5.jpg","hash":"zain_feat_5ccdd22be5","name":"Azizi Zain"},"banner_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/zain_banner_df071e9b34.jpg","hash":"zain_banner_df071e9b34","name":"Azizi Zain"},"media_images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/zain_6_e5ef7db798.jpg","hash":"zain_6_e5ef7db798","name":"Azizi Zain"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestat